{"id":"da69678f58652b67","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper.md","title":"The Book’s Binary Wrapper Code","display":"df-smullyan-binary-wrapper — The Book’s Binary Wrapper Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper"],"display":"df-smullyan-binary-wrapper — The Book’s Binary Wrapper Code","source":"第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-binary-wrapper — The Book’s Binary Wrapper Code"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in E_E\">\\(X\\in E_E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_E^2,\\Pi_E\">\\(W_E^2,\\Pi_E\\)</span> 为下文定义的二元 wrapper 与码函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_2=g_E(\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=)\">\\(\\kappa_2=g_E(\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_E\">\\(r_E\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E\">\\(v_1^E\\)</span> 的 wrapper 码函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}binary\\text{-}wrapper}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E^2(X;m,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset W_E(X,m)\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\Pi_E(e,m,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_2*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}r_E(e,m))*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E^2(E_e;m,n))&amp;=\\Pi_E(e,m,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}binary\\text{-}wrapper}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E^2(X;m,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset W_E(X,m)\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\Pi_E(e,m,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_2*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}r_E(e,m))*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E^2(E_e;m,n))&amp;=\\Pi_E(e,m,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[m,n]\">\\(E[m,n]\\)</span>，先绑定第一变量、再在外层绑定第二变量。二元公式的 wrapper 与真正数码实例可证等价，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_E(h,n,h)\\in P\">\\(\\Pi_E(h,n,h)\\in P\\)</span> 等价于公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_h(n,h)\">\\(E_h(n,h)\\)</span> 可证；这为 Shepherdson 的自引用表示构造提供桥梁。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_E\">\\(\\Pi_E\\)</span> 不等于本地素数幂编码的实例码函数。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in E_E","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_E^2,\\Pi_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_2=g_E(\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=)","display":false},{"tex":"r_E","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}binary\\text{-}wrapper}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E^2(X;m,n)&\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_2^E\\mathtt{(}v_2^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset W_E(X,m)\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\Pi_E(e,m,n)&\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_2*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}r_E(e,m))*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E^2(E_e;m,n))&=\\Pi_E(e,m,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E[m,n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_E(h,n,h)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"E_h(n,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_E","display":false}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]] → [[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]记载原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的具体操作。连接运算按左结合解释，并保留合法串拼接的条件。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]"}],"outgoing":["6deaff22ee062525"]}